{"sha":"378f8479b8b703d098b46de1cec9ea648f12ea69","node_id":"C_kwDOAWaYQdoAKDM3OGY4NDc5YjhiNzAzZDA5OGI0NmRlMWNlYzllYTY0OGYxMmVhNjk","commit":{"author":{"name":"kevin","email":"5299031+kevin9327@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-13T16:01:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-13T16:01:56Z"},"message":"fix(http1): drop Content-Length when a response also has Transfer-Encoding (#4264)\n\nThe HTTP/1 server decoder already removes Content-Length when\nTransfer-Encoding is present. The client decoder preferred\nTransfer-Encoding for the body length, but still exposed both headers.\n\nRFC 7230 §3.3.3 says Transfer-Encoding overrides Content-Length. Remove\nthe Content-Length header from parsed responses so callers cannot treat\nit as authoritative.\n\nCloses #4263","tree":{"sha":"cdb47a2b7493838629bafb840eb69602f3a0a3c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/git/trees/cdb47a2b7493838629bafb840eb69602f3a0a3c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/git/commits/378f8479b8b703d098b46de1cec9ea648f12ea69","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq9zR0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATEYQAGYCh7pda2Pfki/eMu7edyaQ\nNg/xFEOWqqpa8B/Wcf/CdbzRnfoF5uYQjk4KBvSyqSKz+yAhD3LM//QKgQuz5q+z\nxXDK8k1ZXeVqAx9zZ1e4D8B5Ej4RDyRw6/CIUSjwNKl/emMmqYi5EX19xvkCvhYi\nxPrSnqEJRhdKFcYYLT6M5pqzUNNAGt4EuPadJkRfQM8wqNbMTuO+paVNkpOuOT55\nu795FyhQpK5DTXhEWDeMBIpz8AbXsaO906pBxeVPH8GumSfCVnkDTFpkHu0M0yr5\nQbeAl5rG4YwVAd5+d+XBvtncgwy1LTVaKbbM/fQeiHb2i12ppYT9ANmUt9kiF7e9\n2T6L96b2p5HC0muOSWhtacDXiys5i4thO0yMnOGfKHYDj8DrlFkFuU0t2QSkLyOb\nkZJMCJG21kTFxtZJOyDfEfrfBc/iPQs63Gj5Te8a5bfuM/9AznvDNYRm+7HZ/gtt\nv7BLI2XPEp6RdMvIO+wXF8Q/aXsM5YJnVTjzWmaVYAhsxbkZbWtSnudkJ/pBuHp5\nAupkYtXs6EwJAQnqt5T0O+jfcWddO4wRcoqhrxfsqdvp1pxtP5PxWlXyRq7D45sP\niuHS4FyV2dFvzYtd9DlKMGaCl9czzK3/rbl5Hk8cd21H9g2FQYVJT54ed9JoHKHM\nTKWLaKUjUbboHjKQcDB3\n=jjlc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree cdb47a2b7493838629bafb840eb69602f3a0a3c7\nparent b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8\nauthor kevin <5299031+kevin9327@users.noreply.github.com> 1794585716 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1794585716 -0500\n\nfix(http1): drop Content-Length when a response also has Transfer-Encoding (#4264)\n\nThe HTTP/1 server decoder already removes Content-Length when\nTransfer-Encoding is present. The client decoder preferred\nTransfer-Encoding for the body length, but still exposed both headers.\n\nRFC 7230 §3.3.3 says Transfer-Encoding overrides Content-Length. Remove\nthe Content-Length header from parsed responses so callers cannot treat\nit as authoritative.\n\nCloses #4263","verified_at":"2026-11-13T16:01:56Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/commits/378f8479b8b703d098b46de1cec9ea648f12ea69","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperium/hyper/commit/378f8479b8b703d098b46de1cec9ea648f12ea69","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/commits/378f8479b8b703d098b46de1cec9ea648f12ea69/comments","author":{"login":"kevin9327","id":5299031,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTkwMzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5299031?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327","html_url":"https://github.com/kevin9327","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevin9327/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/commits/b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperium/hyper/commit/b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8"}],"stats":{"total":42,"additions":30,"deletions":12},"files":[{"sha":"18d587610a1c88c8901c991e974a18afd5f7c443","filename":"src/proto/h1/role.rs","status":"modified","additions":30,"deletions":12,"changes":42,"blob_url":"https://github.com/hyperium/hyper/blob/378f8479b8b703d098b46de1cec9ea648f12ea69/src%2Fproto%2Fh1%2Frole.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/hyperium/hyper/raw/378f8479b8b703d098b46de1cec9ea648f12ea69/src%2Fproto%2Fh1%2Frole.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/contents/src%2Fproto%2Fh1%2Frole.rs?ref=378f8479b8b703d098b46de1cec9ea648f12ea69","patch":"@@ -1161,6 +1161,13 @@ impl Http1Transaction for Client {\n                 headers.append(name, value);\n             }\n \n+            // https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7230#section-3.3.3\n+            // Transfer-Encoding overrides Content-Length; drop the latter so\n+            // the exposed headers match the server-side decoder.\n+            if headers.contains_key(header::TRANSFER_ENCODING) {\n+                headers.remove(header::CONTENT_LENGTH);\n+            }\n+\n             let mut extensions = http::Extensions::default();\n \n             if let Some(header_case_map) = header_case_map {\n@@ -2406,19 +2413,30 @@ mod tests {\n             DecodedLength::CLOSE_DELIMITED\n         );\n \n-        // transfer-encoding and content-length = chunked\n-        assert_eq!(\n-            parse(\n-                \"\\\n-                 HTTP/1.1 200 OK\\r\\n\\\n-                 content-length: 10\\r\\n\\\n-                 transfer-encoding: chunked\\r\\n\\\n-                 \\r\\n\\\n-                 \"\n-            )\n-            .decode,\n-            DecodedLength::CHUNKED\n+        // transfer-encoding and content-length = chunked; Content-Length is dropped\n+        let msg = parse(\n+            \"\\\n+             HTTP/1.1 200 OK\\r\\n\\\n+             content-length: 100000\\r\\n\\\n+             transfer-encoding: chunked\\r\\n\\\n+             \\r\\n\\\n+             \",\n         );\n+        assert_eq!(msg.decode, DecodedLength::CHUNKED);\n+        assert!(!msg.head.headers.contains_key(header::CONTENT_LENGTH));\n+        assert!(msg.head.headers.contains_key(header::TRANSFER_ENCODING));\n+\n+        let msg = parse(\n+            \"\\\n+             HTTP/1.1 200 OK\\r\\n\\\n+             transfer-encoding: chunked\\r\\n\\\n+             content-length: 100000\\r\\n\\\n+             \\r\\n\\\n+             \",\n+        );\n+        assert_eq!(msg.decode, DecodedLength::CHUNKED);\n+        assert!(!msg.head.headers.contains_key(header::CONTENT_LENGTH));\n+        assert!(msg.head.headers.contains_key(header::TRANSFER_ENCODING));\n \n         // HEAD can have content-length, but not body\n         assert_eq!("}]}